 " Maybe Monkey Land government jealous of Banana Land's bananas and instead of telling them", "tokens": [51597, 6674, 26997, 6379, 1230, 19354, 286, 40058, 6379, 338, 35484, 290, 2427, 286, 5149, 606, 51817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18081224060058593, "compression_ratio": 1.9024390243902438, "no_speech_prob": 0.07582932710647583}, {"id": 50, "seek": 16832, "start": 168.4, "end": 171.57999999999998, "text": " how they feel, they try to ruin their economy.", "tokens": [50367, 703, 484, 1254, 11, 484, 1949, 284, 16866, 511, 3773, 13, 50526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 51, "seek": 16832, "start": 171.57999999999998, "end": 176.12, "text": " Maybe Monkey Land government use tariffs as bargaining tools for more important political", "tokens": [50526, 6674, 26997, 6379, 1230, 779, 29240, 355, 23189, 4899, 329, 517, 1593, 1964, 50753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 52, "seek": 16832, "start": 176.12, "end": 177.16, "text": " negotiations.", "tokens": [50753, 9825, 13, 50805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 53, "seek": 16832, "start": 177.16, "end": 180.44, "text": " Or maybe Monkey Land government simply want to make more money.", "tokens": [50805, 1471, 3863, 26997, 6379, 1230, 2391, 765, 284, 787, 517, 1637, 13, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 54, "seek": 16832, "start": 180.44, "end": 184.35999999999999, "text": " So if tariff make everything more expensive, why do we even have them?", "tokens": [50969, 1406, 611, 36427, 787, 2279, 517, 5789, 11, 1521, 466, 356, 772, 423, 606, 30, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 55, "seek": 16832, "start": 184.35999999999999, "end": 187.04, "text": " Well Monkey government want money.", "tokens": [51165, 3894, 26997, 1230, 765, 1637, 13, 51299], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 56, "seek": 16832, "start": 187.04, "end": 189.07999999999998, "text": " That's pretty much it.", "tokens": [51299, 1320, 338, 2495, 881, 340, 13, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 57, "seek": 16832, "start": 189.07999999999998, "end": 194.95999999999998, "text": " Monkey government may think they help small business with tariffs, but this isn't always", "tokens": [51401, 26997, 1230, 743, 892, 484, 1037, 1402, 1597, 351, 29240, 11, 475, 428, 2125, 470, 1464, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 58, "seek": 16832, "start": 194.95999999999998, "end": 195.95999999999998, "text": " true.", "tokens": [51695, 2081, 13, 51745], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493907891430902, "compression_ratio": 1.7244094488188977, "no_speech_prob": 0.042425766587257385}, {"id": 59, "seek": 19596, "start": 195.96, "end": 200.84, "text": " Monkey businesses import other things from Banana Land to help run business.", "tokens": [50363, 26997, 5692, 1330, 584, 1243, 422, 40058, 6379, 284, 1037, 1057, 1597, 13, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 60, "seek": 19596, "start": 200.84, "end": 202.68, "text": " Tariffs make these more expensive.", "tokens": [50607, 14110, 10203, 787, 777, 517, 5789, 13, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 61, "seek": 19596, "start": 202.68, "end": 203.96, "text": " Monkeys have to pay more.", "tokens": [50699, 2892, 13083, 423, 284, 1414, 517, 13, 50763], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 62, "seek": 19596, "start": 203.96, "end": 204.96, "text": " Monkeys stress.", "tokens": [50763, 2892, 13083, 5503, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 63, "seek": 19596, "start": 204.96, "end": 206.28, "text": " Monkeys tired of this bullshit.", "tokens": [50813, 2892, 13083, 10032, 286, 428, 20041, 13, 50879], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 64, "seek": 19596, "start": 206.28, "end": 211.04000000000002, "text": " Big banana corporations could lose some money from tariffs, but small banana stand could", "tokens": [50879, 4403, 25996, 10225, 714, 4425, 617, 1637, 422, 29240, 11, 475, 1402, 25996, 1302, 714, 51117], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 65, "seek": 19596, "start": 211.04000000000002, "end": 212.8, "text": " go out of business.", "tokens": [51117, 467, 503, 286, 1597, 13, 51205], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 66, "seek": 19596, "start": 212.8, "end": 216.72, "text": " Future products can also be delayed because of sudden increase in tariffs.", "tokens": [51205, 10898, 3186, 460, 635, 307, 11038, 780, 286, 4802, 2620, 287, 29240, 13, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 67, "seek": 19596, "start": 216.72, "end": 220.48000000000002, "text": " Products Monkey was really looking forward to.", "tokens": [51401, 18675, 26997, 373, 1107, 2045, 2651, 284, 13, 51589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 68, "seek": 19596, "start": 220.48000000000002, "end": 221.92000000000002, "text": " The Future of Tariffs.", "tokens": [51589, 383, 10898, 286, 14110, 10203, 13, 51661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 69, "seek": 19596, "start": 221.92000000000002, "end": 223.76000000000002, "text": " Tariffs affect physical products.", "tokens": [51661, 14110, 10203, 2689, 3518, 3186, 13, 51753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1297144765439241, "compression_ratio": 1.758364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.515928328037262}, {"id": 70, "seek": 22376, "start": 223.76, "end": 226.23999999999998, "text": " Because monkeys can touch with monkey hands.", "tokens": [50363, 4362, 26697, 460, 3638, 351, 21657, 2832, 13, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 71, "seek": 22376, "start": 226.23999999999998, "end": 229.2, "text": " But how will Monkey government tariff digital products?", "tokens": [50487, 887, 703, 481, 26997, 1230, 36427, 4875, 3186, 30, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 72, "seek": 22376, "start": 229.2, "end": 230.2, "text": " Ebooks?", "tokens": [50635, 412, 12106, 30, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 73, "seek": 22376, "start": 230.2, "end": 231.88, "text": " AI generated artwork?", "tokens": [50685, 9552, 7560, 16257, 30, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 74, "seek": 22376, "start": 231.88, "end": 233.35999999999999, "text": " NFTs?", "tokens": [50769, 399, 9792, 82, 30, 50843], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 75, "seek": 22376, "start": 233.35999999999999, "end": 234.35999999999999, "text": " Environmental Tariffs.", "tokens": [50843, 13272, 14110, 10203, 13, 50893], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 76, "seek": 22376, "start": 234.35999999999999, "end": 239.04, "text": " Some monkey governments use environmental tariffs, taxing countries that harm monkey's", "tokens": [50893, 2773, 21657, 6905, 779, 6142, 29240, 11, 36587, 2678, 326, 4419, 21657, 338, 51127], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 77, "seek": 22376, "start": 239.04, "end": 240.23999999999998, "text": " natural habitat.", "tokens": [51127, 3288, 20018, 13, 51187], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 78, "seek": 22376, "start": 240.23999999999998, "end": 244.95999999999998, "text": " Monkey government tax products based on how much carbon emissions it took to make product.", "tokens": [51187, 26997, 1230, 1687, 3186, 1912, 319, 703, 881, 6588, 8971, 340, 1718, 284, 787, 1720, 13, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 79, "seek": 22376, "start": 244.95999999999998, "end": 246.44, "text": " The Banana War.", "tokens": [51423, 383, 40058, 1810, 13, 51497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 80, "seek": 22376, "start": 246.44, "end": 248.35999999999999, "text": " Yes, this really happened.", "tokens": [51497, 3363, 11, 428, 1107, 3022, 13, 51593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 81, "seek": 22376, "start": 248.35999999999999, "end": 250.79999999999998, "text": " Monkey often use bananas to explain money.", "tokens": [51593, 26997, 1690, 779, 35484, 284, 4727, 1637, 13, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22988238158049407, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.12219356745481491}, {"id": 82, "seek": 25080, "start": 250.8, "end": 255.64000000000001, "text": " However this time, when monkeys say bananas, monkey mean actual bananas.", "tokens": [50363, 2102, 428, 640, 11, 618, 26697, 910, 35484, 11, 21657, 1612, 4036, 35484, 13, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 83, "seek": 25080, "start": 255.64000000000001, "end": 261.6, "text": " In 1993, the European monkeys gave their friends, the Caribbean monkeys, a discount on tariffs", "tokens": [50605, 554, 9656, 11, 262, 3427, 26697, 2921, 511, 2460, 11, 262, 18020, 26697, 11, 257, 9780, 319, 29240, 50903], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 84, "seek": 25080, "start": 261.6, "end": 262.68, "text": " for their bananas.", "tokens": [50903, 329, 511, 35484, 13, 50957], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 85, "seek": 25080, "start": 262.68, "end": 267.52, "text": " This was to support Caribbean monkeys' struggling economy by giving them tax breaks on their", "tokens": [50957, 770, 373, 284, 1104, 18020, 26697, 6, 9648, 3773, 416, 3501, 606, 1687, 9457, 319, 511, 51199], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 86, "seek": 25080, "start": 267.52, "end": 268.8, "text": " bananas.", "tokens": [51199, 35484, 13, 51263], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 87, "seek": 25080, "start": 268.8, "end": 271.44, "text": " But American monkeys were not happy.", "tokens": [51263, 887, 1605, 26697, 547, 407, 3772, 13, 51395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 88, "seek": 25080, "start": 271.44, "end": 274.28000000000003, "text": " They import banana too and didn't get discount.", "tokens": [51395, 1119, 1330, 25996, 1165, 290, 1422, 470, 651, 9780, 13, 51537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 89, "seek": 25080, "start": 274.28000000000003, "end": 277.88, "text": " They thought it was unfair European monkeys were playing favorites.", "tokens": [51537, 1119, 1807, 340, 373, 11675, 3427, 26697, 547, 2712, 18852, 13, 51717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15013797760009764, "compression_ratio": 1.764, "no_speech_prob": 0.13327758014202118}, {"id": 90, "seek": 27788, "start": 277.88, "end": 283.0, "text": " So the American monkeys put tariffs on European monkeys, other products, and retaliation.", "tokens": [50363, 1406, 262, 1605, 26697, 1234, 29240, 319, 3427, 26697, 11, 584, 3186, 11, 290, 24671, 13, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 91, "seek": 27788, "start": 283.0, "end": 289.76, "text": " Eventually, the WTO, the World Trade Orangutan, had to step in.", "tokens": [50619, 16178, 11, 262, 47074, 11, 262, 2159, 9601, 1471, 648, 37878, 11, 550, 284, 2239, 287, 13, 50957], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 92, "seek": 27788, "start": 289.76, "end": 295.56, "text": " But this banana trade war lasted nearly 20 years before Euro monkeys finally gave US", "tokens": [50957, 887, 428, 25996, 3292, 1175, 15436, 3016, 1160, 812, 878, 1898, 26697, 3443, 2921, 1294, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 93, "seek": 27788, "start": 295.56, "end": 298.8, "text": " monkeys lower tariffs on bananas as well.", "tokens": [51247, 26697, 2793, 29240, 319, 35484, 355, 880, 13, 51409], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 94, "seek": 27788, "start": 298.8, "end": 299.8, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [51409, 6952, 345, 13, 51459], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 95, "seek": 27788, "start": 299.8, "end": 305.36, "text": " To say thank you to all 240,000 monkeys that are now in troop, Primate Economics has donated", "tokens": [51459, 1675, 910, 5875, 345, 284, 477, 14956, 11, 830, 26697, 326, 389, 783, 287, 31874, 11, 1736, 1920, 18963, 468, 15863, 51737], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18203584964458758, "compression_ratio": 1.579150579150579, "no_speech_prob": 0.04454560577869415}, {"id": 96, "seek": 27788, "start": 305.36, "end": 307.44, "text": " $500 to save the chimps.", "tokens": [51737, 720, 4059, 284, 3613, 